// STATUS: SINGLE-FILE LEDGER + MERKLE + SHA-256 + SELF-TEST
// RUNTIME: Node.js (native), browser (with crypto.subtle fallback)
// PURPOSE: Ingest raw dumps, hash them, maintain Merkle-style head, export + self-test.
